# Squeak By lasts the turn it resolves and no longer: "gets +1/+1 until end of turn" and "can't be blocked by creatures with
# power 3 or greater this turn" (CR 611.2a, 514.2). Turn 3 Bot1 casts it on Mouse #1 (3/2), which carries the restriction:
# Cliffhaven Sell-Sword (power 3) may not block it and it goes unblocked (Elite Vanguard is there so blockers are asked for).
# On turn 5 the same Mouse is a 2/1 again with no restriction, and Sell-Sword blocks it; they trade.

